{{Quote|You've got some medals coming your way|[[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] to Clone Force 99, Rex, and Echo|<ref name="Unfinished Business">{{TCW|Unfinished Business (episode)}}</ref>}}
After the [[Battle of Anaxes]], a '''medal''' was awarded to [[Clone Force 99]], as well as [[Clone Captain|Captain]] [[Rex]] and [[Advanced Recon Commando|ARC trooper]] [[Echo]], who was simultaneously promoted to [[Clone Corporal]]. Following the mission, [[Jedi General]] [[Mace Windu]] thanked the [[Cloning|clone]] [[Clone trooper|troopers]] for their service, adding that because of their courage and bravery, the [[Galactic Republic|Republic's]] [[shipyard]]s would soon be working again. However, the [[Genetically defective clone|CT-99s]] declined to accept the [[medal]]s, with [[Tech]] commenting that they were "not really our thing". [[Clone Sergeant]] [[Hunter]] invited Echo to join them and Rex remarked that if that was where he felt his place was, then it was where he belonged; thereafter Echo was absorbed into the Bad Batch as the fifth member of the [[squad]].<ref name="Unfinished Business" />
